{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q11", "domain": "unknown", "question": "大约哪个时间段，运程最佳？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字（辛丑、庚子、丁酉、辛丑），日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，全局金水极重，丁火身弱无疑。喜用神为木火，忌金水。\n\n大运排布中，需看哪一步大运能补足木火，同时制衡金水。\n\n- **A. 23—32岁**：对应戊戌大运（1978-1987），戊土伤官泄火，戌为燥土但藏火，此运土重晦火，且戊土生金，不利。\n- **B. 33—42岁**：对应丁酉大运（1988-1997），丁火比肩帮身，但酉金为忌，且与命局酉金加重，金旺克木，火根不固，运程平平。\n- **C. 43—52岁**：对应丙申大运（1998-2007），丙火劫财帮身，但申金为忌，且申子半合水局，水势更旺，克火严重，此运压力大，非最佳。\n- **D. 53—62岁**：对应乙未大运（2008-2017），乙木偏印生火，未为燥土，内藏丁火，且未土制水，木火得地，对身弱丁火是极大补益，此运最为有利。\n\n综合判断，53-62岁乙未大运，木火通明，制水护火，是命主一生中运程最佳阶段。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q11", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3902, "response_id": "c106d949-4eac-4641-95f7-a988ca279cc9", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 408, "completion_tokens": 351, "total_tokens": 759, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 24}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q12", "domain": "relationship", "question": "何时结婚？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据八字命理分析，日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，需木火帮扶。年柱、时柱辛丑金土耗火，月柱庚子金水更增寒湿，日支酉金为偏财，全局财官过旺，日主身弱。男命以财星为妻星，八字中财星（金）极旺，但日主丁火弱，难以担财，主婚姻较晚或感情压力大。\n\n大运排布中，27-36岁行丁酉运，比肩帮身，但酉金为财，财旺身弱，感情机会虽有但难稳定；37-46岁丙申运，劫财帮身，但申子半合水局，官杀更旺，压力增大；47-56岁乙未运，偏印生身，未土为食神制水，运势转好，但此时已近晚年。综合来看，命主身弱财旺，早年感情难成，中年后运势稍缓，但结婚最可能出现在身旺能担财的运程中，即47岁后乙未运（2008年起），此运木土助身，财星受制，婚姻可成。\n\n因此，结婚时间应在43-52岁之间。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q12", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4104, "response_id": "b9b8662d-4434-4f85-a0e7-6f19f6684160", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 401, "completion_tokens": 282, "total_tokens": 683, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 17}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q13", "domain": "career", "question": "有官非刑事出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，全局金水势力强，火势衰微。年柱、时柱均为辛丑，月柱庚子，金水成势，丁火孤立无援，属于身弱至极的命格。这种格局容易在官杀（水）过旺的岁运中引发官非刑狱之事。\n\n大运排布中，丙申运（37-46岁，1998-2007年）为劫财透干，但地支申子半合水局，加重官杀力量，且申金为财星生杀，此运中水势更旺，对日主形成严重克伐。流年若再遇水旺或金旺，极易触发官非。\n\n具体到选项：\n- A（13-22岁）为己亥、戊戌运，土运尚能制水，虽有压力但非最凶。\n- B（23-32岁）为丁酉、丙申运，丙火帮身但被辛合，酉金生水，官非风险上升，但尚未到极点。\n- C（33-42岁）为丙申运后半段及乙未运初，申子合水，水势滔天，且丙火被辛合绊，无力制水，此阶段最易因财或冲突引发刑事官非。\n- D（43-53岁）为乙未、甲午运，木火渐旺，日主得生扶，官非风险反而降低。\n\n综合判断，33-42岁（丙申运中后期）水势最旺，官杀攻身最烈，最符合“官非刑事出现”的应期。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q13", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4985, "response_id": "74fb957d-dabd-433e-b0a1-d5ad9db5f2c8", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 407, "completion_tokens": 371, "total_tokens": 778, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 23}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q14", "domain": "unknown", "question": "有凶劫之灾出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱辛丑，月柱庚子，日柱丁酉，时柱辛丑。日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，全局金水极旺，丁火无根，属于身弱至极的命格。年、时柱辛丑均为偏财，月柱庚子为正财，财星重重，但日主弱极，财多身弱，易因财致祸。\n\n大运方面，7岁前走己亥运（食神），但命局水旺，食神生财，财多身弱，幼年体质弱，易有灾病。\n\n流年分析：\n- 1965年乙巳：乙木偏印生身，巳火为日主之根，看似有救，但巳火被月支子水冲克（子巳暗合但水势强），且巳酉丑合金局，火根被合化，反而加重金水之势，此年有凶险。\n- 1968年戊申：戊土伤官，申金正财，申子辰合水局（申子半合水），水势更旺，丁火被冲克，但此年已入己亥大运，亥水冲巳（但无巳），水势泛滥，凶险程度高。\n- 1971年辛亥：辛金偏财，亥水正官，亥子丑会水局，水势滔天，丁火被灭，此年凶险极大。\n- 1974年甲寅：甲木正印，寅木为丁火长生之地，且寅午戌（无午戌）但寅木生火，此年有救，凶险程度低。\n\n综合比较，1971年辛亥，水势最旺，丁火全无生扶，且财官杀混杂，凶劫之灾最明显。但题目问“有凶劫之灾出现的时间”，通常指最早或最明显的灾年。1965年乙巳虽有巳火，但被合化，且4岁幼年，灾祸可能为病灾。然而，1968年戊申，申子半合水，水旺克火，且大运己亥加重水势，7岁也是灾年。但1971年辛亥，水势更集中，且亥子丑三会水局，丁火被彻底淹没，凶险程度最高。\n\n但根据传统命理，凶灾往往在忌神最旺且无制之年。1971年辛亥，天干辛金生水，地支亥子丑会水，全局水势泛滥，丁火日主被冲克无救，此年凶劫最重。因此选C。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "6fbdcedb130f902d280faa5ed3bd785b4042c3080e46ea9c87e9c8395734596e", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q14", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 7654, "response_id": "4ba40994-4a1c-443f-aaec-c1c25ad2bead", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 470, "completion_tokens": 582, "total_tokens": 1052, "pr