{"case_id": "female_19831028_P004-Q17", "domain": "relationship", "question": "第一段婚姻是何时嫁？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为己土，生于戌月，土旺。年柱癸亥、月柱壬戌，水旺财星透干，但日主身强，喜财官。女命以官杀为夫星，原局月干壬水为正财，时支巳火藏庚金伤官，夫星（官杀）不显，需大运流年引动。\n\n大运排布：13-22岁行甲子运（正官），此运官星透出，是婚缘的关键时期。2003年癸未，流年天干癸水为偏财，地支未土为比肩，财星虽透但无官星引动，且未土与日支丑土相冲，感情不稳，非婚期。2005年乙酉，流年天干乙木为七杀（夫星），地支酉金为食神，乙木七杀坐酉金受克，但大运甲子中甲木正官与流年乙木七杀并见，官杀混杂，且酉金与日支丑土半合金局，食神制杀，虽有情缘但非稳定婚期。2007年丁亥，流年天干丁火为偏印，地支亥水为正财，亥水与日支丑土无合，且丁火偏印克食伤，不利婚恋。2009年己丑，流年天干己土为比肩，地支丑土为比肩，与日支丑土伏吟，且大运甲子中甲木正官与流年己土相合（甲己合土），官星被合入日主，此为婚缘合动之象，且流年与日柱伏吟，主婚嫁之事。\n\n综合判断，2009年甲己合，官星合身，且大运正官当旺，是婚嫁最明显之年份。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "6dce3752dc71c1ff036ec757bd56344367aec6d621cb801c4b22fd5bbd5e41a0", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19831028_P004-Q17", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5434, "response_id": "1567d044-4746-4171-8f21-cc4bc6c3bf2c", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 458, "completion_tokens": 422, "total_tokens": 880, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 74}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": 