{"case_id": "male_19710412_P005-Q21", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主在哪一年登记结婚？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据八字命理分析，命主日主为丁火，生于辰月，火气渐衰，需木火生扶。年柱辛亥，月柱壬辰，时柱戊申，日支卯木为印星，可生身。命局中财星（金）较旺，官星（水）透出，婚姻宫（日支卯木）为印星，代表配偶有助力。\n\n结婚年份通常看流年与命局、大运的互动，尤其是合动婚姻宫或出现正财、正官星。命主在1998年戊寅，流年天干戊土为伤官，地支寅木与日支卯木半会木局，增强印星，但伤官透出不利婚；1999年己卯，流年地支卯木与日支卯木伏吟，婚姻宫动，且天干己土为食神，食神生财，有婚恋之象；2002年壬午，流年天干壬水为正官，地支午火为禄神，但午卯相破，婚姻宫有损；2003年癸未，七杀透出，地支未土与卯木半合木局，但七杀主压力，非吉。\n\n综合来看，1999年己卯，婚姻宫伏吟且食神生财，最符合结婚之象。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "30642022bceaf29b0df5c7658859abd121d152d17c228cf1f7efd31c2ce63d23", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19710412_P005-Q21", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4083, "response_id": "e210da7f-a2b7-4d6c-bc89-23d59005e9b8", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 457, "completion_tokens": 300, "total_tokens": 757, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 73}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
